   "texto": [
    "To make a friendly proposal to someone you use «Zullen we... + infinitivo al final?»: «Zullen we om tien uur afspreken?» (Do we meet at 10: 00?). To confirm availability we say «Ik ben vrij» (I am free) or «Ik ben beschikbaar» (I am available). To fire you by setting the date: «Tot morgen!» (See you tomorrow!)."
